{"id":"kreuzung","lemma":"Kreuzung","pos":"noun","rank":4682,"glosses":["crossing, intersection","crossbreeding","crossbreed"],"ipa":"/ˈkʁɔɪ̯t͡sʊŋ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/25/De-Kreuzung.ogg/De-Kreuzung.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Kreuzung","plural":"Kreuzungen"},"examples":[{"text":"Diese Kreuzung ist gefährlich.","en":"This intersection is dangerous.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/700282","words":[{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"dangerous, hazardous"}]},{"text":"Wie heißt diese Kreuzung?","en":"What's the name of this intersection?","words":[{"g":"how"},{"g":"to have a name","l":"heißen"},{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},null]},{"text":"An der nächsten Kreuzung rechts!","en":"Turn right at the next intersection.","words":[{"g":"at / on"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"near","l":"nah"},null,{"g":"on the right"}]},{"text":"Biegen Sie an der Kreuzung rechts ab.","en":"Turn right at the intersection.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1991","words":[{"g":"to bend something"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"at / on"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"on the right"},{"g":"beginning at that time…"}]},{"text":"Der Unfall ereignete sich an der Kreuzung.","en":"The accident happened at that intersection.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"accident"},{"g":"to occur, happen","l":"ereignen"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"at / on"},{"g":"the"},null]}]}